{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"c":1,"y":0.050811584531581966,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.71418099089018916,"w":0.20128620147705079,"h":0.020436968312887438},{"x":0.19204151757028171,"y":0.10029069734225082,"h":0.020423088313984317,"w":0.30622838338216146,"c":1,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 2"},{"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7 score.","x":0.19199956542805446,"h":0.019800431750052527,"c":1,"w":0.5848547363281249,"y":0.13784009277093123},{"x":0.19377161899259154,"h":0.017593413820793935,"w":0.67474049886067711,"t":"Firstly, tall apartment blocks economize land area since it makes use of its vertical","c":1,"y":0.16715116250833584},{"x":0.19199578579299176,"h":0.020500640922530344,"c":1,"w":0.67658309936523442,"t":"space compared to multiple residential areas which waste a major portion of area,","y":0.18736988991598413},{"w":0.6438054402669271,"y":0.20667205075311801,"t":"multiple apartments can squeeze in more homes at each floor. Besides, heavily","h":0.023379150347913158,"x":0.19367124879677258,"c":1},{"t":"populated cities are rife with locals and expatriates seeking a place to live in a while","y":0.23093072110730783,"w":0.68339101155598958,"h":0.017615790797581243,"x":0.19204151836144395,"c":1},{"h":0.021485162498735777,"c":1,"x":0.19199677422468597,"y":0.25033981452036125,"t":"they go about their business there. By utilising the apartment's geometrical structure,","w":0.70598876953125},{"x":0.19204152367039418,"w":0.46193771362304692,"t":"more homes can be provided for them at a cheaper cost.","y":0.27325581366005736,"h":0.017506957804931611,"c":1},{"x":0.19377162277762428,"t":"Moreover, apartment blocks usually offer homes at a price lower than the ones set for","w":0.6989619445800781,"c":1,"y":0.30230930689502822,"h":0.018911623304085357},{"y":0.32400279948381583,"w":0.72145329793294255,"h":0.019020456296735211,"c":1,"x":0.19204151703807015,"t":"onland homes. Bungalows, semi-detached, double story houses and others would usually"},{"h":0.020572398074278797,"y":0.34300398966376133,"x":0.19198591893127856,"w":0.67656748453776039,"t":"be a pain in the wallet for someone without a stable or sufficient income, much like","c":1},{"x":0.19200066387336354,"y":0.36476839767047031,"t":"those who are new to the city. By building more apartments, more affordable housing","w":0.69558664957682292,"h":0.021493228354430682,"c":1},{"x":0.19204152407556688,"w":0.68512110392252601,"y":0.38803359019969652,"t":"can be accessed by many layers of the society. To paint a picture, we can visualize an","h":0.018943153952617919,"c":1},{"y":0.40832750173126331,"w":0.68166091918945315,"h":0.017544591568665835,"c":1,"t":"example of a rookie worker at a major firm in a big city like Kuala Lumpur. He or she","x":0.19204151263550537},{"h":0.017441861023846261,"t":"might not be planning to permanently reside there and raise a family but they definitely","y":0.43023255785799508,"w":0.71972320556640623,"x":0.19204151131779004,"c":1},{"x":0.19198691202005325,"y":0.44904342834162136,"h":0.020458666572544137,"w":0.69043095906575525,"c":1,"t":"have the option of a stable house to return to at the end of a day's work. For families,"},{"w":0.69723185221354156,"y":0.47235829244778249,"x":0.19204151325663599,"c":1,"t":"they definitely can benefit the most as they do not have to pay a throat-choking price","h":0.017494751574527623},{"h":0.018975702343160483,"w":0.63148788452148441,"c":1,"x":0.19204152679202594,"y":0.49265220436635127,"t":"while still juggling the cost of raising children and dealing with bills and taxes."},{"y":0.523093072029303,"w":0.65397923787434897,"t":"In conclusion, governments should implement an urban-planning scheme which","c":1,"h":0.019058090727841481,"x":0.19031141903860391},{"y":0.54193976139194533,"c":1,"w":0.69397516886393218,"t":"involve building more tall apartment blocks in large cities. In doing so, the percentage","x":0.19020227958865482,"h":0.02273101219353435},{"x":0.19204151835784272,"w":0.68339101155598958,"h":0.017518146293325154,"y":0.5654069764625792,"c":1,"t":"of homelessness may decrease largely. Not only that, the productivity of the city will"},{"t":"improve and boost the country's overall economy. Homes are crucial for a harmonious","y":0.58572428302237289,"w":0.69723185221354167,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1,"x":0.1903114094404782},{"w":0.71972320556640623,"x":0.19204151131736411,"h":0.017582225332400281,"c":1,"y":0.60741777494473426,"t":"and safe community as well as healing one's mental health. Although there may be other"},{"x":0.1919846592875869,"t":"mechanisms in place to achieve this common goal, I still stand firm with my reasons.","y":0.62735669876141675,"c":1,"w":0.68349517822265626,"h":0.022165478652302673},{"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"x":0.19204151756272314,"y":0.66569767417860504,"w":0.27162630716959635},{"h":0.018938068579426148,"c":1,"y":0.68750000002838674,"w":0.62283737182617183,"x":0.23183390915611823,"t":"This is a strong response overall. The first part addresses the benefits of tall"},{"t":"apartment blocks, and includes the efficient use of 'vertical space' to fit in more","x":0.23177441732013998,"w":0.65409739176432291,"c":1,"y":0.70455019430653587,"h":0.020950486895252252},{"t":"homes, the benefits of 'geometrical structure' providing cheaper costs. The writer","x":0.23183391887542143,"y":0.72238372101731807,"h":0.020443431141494939,"c":1,"w":0.67301035563151035},{"h":0.017589345522240563,"t":"states that homes in apartments are usually more affordable and gives examples","x":0.23183390785930308,"y":0.74273255785709913,"w":0.66089965820312502,"c":1},{"x":0.23183391096202211,"t":"of [rookie workers] and [families] in Kuala Lumpur, having a safe place to return to","y":0.7601744182746718,"w":0.66955017089843749,"h":0.020441396992218253,"c":1},{"w":0.23564898173014323,"h":0.019318992395848111,"c":1,"x":0.22821821942630674,"t":"[at the end of a day's work].","y":0.77794359786020417},{"t":"There is no mention of the advantages of other types of homes, but in this kind","y":0.8051084677196203,"c":1,"w":0.65224914550781254,"x":0.23183390463903911,"h":0.019019439222096812},{"w":0.66955017089843749,"c":1,"x":0.23183391099431408,"h":0.019020456296735211,"t":"of question, it does not need to be presented. In the conclusion, the writer states","y":0.82400279948337429},{"h":0.017567985620091542,"y":0.84289713093577068,"x":0.23010379830191369,"w":0.65916956583658859,"c":1,"t":"that governments should build these kinds of tall apartment blocks, to decrease"},{"h":0.018968582820692026,"t":"homelessness, increase the economy, and benefit community mental health.","c":1,"y":0.860391882261208,"x":0.23183390657942748,"w":0.62975779215494787},{"x":0.23183392191422569,"c":1,"h":0.018900434815691813,"y":0.88662790677159276,"w":0.67128026326497392,"t":"Progression is logical. Linking expressions are appropriate [Firstly | Besides | By..."},{"y":0.90552325553235236,"t":"| Moreover | To paint a picture] with some good examples of reference [the ones |","c":1,"w":0.67820068359374996,"h":0.017499837615091218,"x":0.23183391417198304},{"t":"those who are | which] and paragraphing is helpful.","x":0.23183391589684921,"y":0.92296511607391851,"w":0.42387542724609373,"h":0.018952308959106712,"c":1},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"t":"127","x":0.8788927341186773,"y":0.95203488378563161,"c":1,"w":0.032871971130371103}]}